 # jt — JobTrack command-line client

 A small CLI for interacting with the JobTrack REST API. Designed so an AI agent
 (via CodeyBox) can use it to file new tickets, move tickets through states, and
 query work without going through the Blazor UI.

-This directory is a **scaffold**. Most subcommands throw `NotImplementedException`
